   blast4.sigkill_holder.child_ppid_after_host_kill	1
   blast4.sigkill_holder.child_reparented_to_init	true
   	Nothing reaps a tool's children when the engine dies inside the host
   	process: there is no kill_on_drop on a process looprs did not spawn.
   	ADR-0006 makes leaving the terminal clean possible; it cannot help with a
   	panic or a kill in looprs' own process.
